"href=\"https://portal.azure.com\" target=\"_blank\">Azure "
"Portal</a></li></ul>See documentation for detailed setup instructions."
msgstr ""
"<strong>자격 증명을 얻는 방법:</strong><br><ul><li><strong>Google:</strong> <a "
"href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com\" target=\"_blank\">Google Cloud "
"Console</a>을 방문하세요</li><li><strong>Apple:</strong> <a "
"href=\"https://developer.apple.com\" target=\"_blank\">Apple Developer "
"Portal</a>을 방문하세요</li><li><strong>Microsoft:</strong> <a "
"href=\"https://portal.azure.com\" target=\"_blank\">Azure Portal</a>을 "
"방문하세요</li></ul>자세한 설정 지침은 문서를 참조하세요."

